Influenced by nationalistic and socialistic thoughts. Always stood for the protection of rights and welfare of farmers, laborers, youth and backward classes. Hail from a humble background and decided to pursue my goals with determination and conviction to fight for humanity. Always strived for creating legal awareness by educating people about their rights and duties and also help enforce the basic rights of those in rural regions.
Other Positions held
 President (1986-87), District Re-organisation Committee of Karnataka State;
 President, Nehru Yuvaka Kendra, Hebballi, District Bagalkot, Karnataka;
 President, Bar Association, Badami District Bagalkot, Karnataka
